data: {"id": "7e0848f951ea4d9d-thinking-parallel_evidence-1370", "run_id": "7e0848f951ea4d9d", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "---\n\n## 证据结论\n\n### 实体身份与生命周期\n- **Pod**: `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz`，UID `86b6a1bf-eb40-431d-bfb5-00fe85ed2475`\n- **当前状态**: **Pending / ContainerCreating**（未 Running）\n- **节点**: `node2` (10.2.0.50)\n- **控制器链**: Deployment `workload` → ReplicaSet `workload-5b5fc86c` → Pod\n- **容器**: `app` (镜像 `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`，命令 `python3 -c \"import time; time.sleep(3600)\"`)\n\n### 已采集事实（支持/解释当前异常）\n\n| 维度 | 事实 | 与异常的关联 |\n|------|------|-------------|\n| **kubectl describe*", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788769044414, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

