data: {"id": "7e0848f951ea4d9d-final", "run_id": "7e0848f951ea4d9d", "seq": 1375, "ts_ms": 1788769062943, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz` | ContainerCreating | Pod aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz 卡在 ContainerCreating / Pending 状态 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning FailedMount ... MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` (fact-50dcb5ed3322) | 提供挂载失败的核心事实，明确缺失的 ConfigMap 名称。 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning FailedMount ... timed out waiting for the condition` (fact-ae96b59ef4ac) | 确认挂载尝试持续失败并达到超时阈值。 |\n| 3 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"ContainerCreating\"} = 1` (fact-055d5b096600) | 证实容器处于 Waiting 状态，与 K8s 事件中的挂载卡死现象一致。 |\n| 4 | K8s State | kubernetes | `pod.status = Pending` (fact-dd077feb7cf9) | 确认 Pod 处于 Pending 状态。 |\n| 5 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.resource_limit.memory = 32Mi` (fact-0a2664da741e) | 确认 Pod 的资源限制配置，非导致挂载失败的因素。 |\n\n**证据说明**：\nPrometheus 监控指标 (`kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason`) 证实了容器卡在 `ContainerCreating` 状态，这与 Kubernetes 事件日志中显示的 `FailedMount` 及其底层原因（ConfigMap 缺失）完全印证。所有 Kubernetes 状态与指标均一致指向同一根因。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap 'unavailable-config' 在命名空间 'aiops-case-03' 中缺失 → kubelet 挂载 Volume 'input' 失败并持续重试 → 容器 'app' 无法完成挂载并进入 Running 状态 → Pod 状态维持在 Pending/ContainerCreating\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为**配置错误**：Pod 定义中引用的 ConfigMap `unavailable-config` 在 `aiops-case-03` 命名空间中不存在，导致 `kubelet` 挂载卷失败。这一结论由 K8s 事件日志 (`FailedMount`) 提供直接证据，并由 Prometheus 指标（容器持续处于 `ContainerCreating` 状态）予以佐证。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.2m\n├─ 问题定位: 24.2s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 40.4s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz: 40.4s (Evidence 30.1s, RCA 10.2s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.1s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz**: pod-imagepull-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 72.808, "metrics": {"run_id": "7e0848f951ea4d9d", "mttr": {"value": "1.2m", "seconds": 72.81478643417358, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-imagepull-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 72814.78643417358, "llm_calls": 15, "llm_duration_ms": 69295.49598693848, "tool_calls": 14, "executed_tool_calls": 10, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 3, "successful_tool_calls": 13, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 6687.5159740448, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 3189.9707317352295}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 24208.207368850708, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 40436.52629852295, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 8147.253513336182, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

